{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026", "label": "RCA: Table Mechanic Defects April 2026", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_a_seat8_winner", "label": "Defect A: Seat 8 Winner Not Detected", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CaseEval::winning_seats() iterated 0..u8::BITS (0..8), so bit 8 (Win::NINTH, seat index 8) was never examined; a sole winner at seat 8 returned an empty vec and the entire pot was destroyed. Fix: iterate 0..self.0.len() \u2014 the runtime collection length, not a compile-time type constant. Pattern: any 0..CONST range over a collection should use collection.len()."}, {"id": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_b_orphaned_none_chips", "label": "Defect B: Orphaned Dead-Money Chips in Multiway Showdown", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When a folded BB's contribution exceeded every active player's commitment, the only remaining TableEquity entry was Seatbit::NONE dead money; showdown_multiway's Phase 2 loop broke with no eligible seats and silently dropped the chips, caught only by the distant ChipAuditFailed check. Fix: drain remaining NONE chips to last_winner before breaking. Pattern: any loop exiting via break over a collection should assert the collection is empty on exit."}, {"id": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_c_seat_index_mismatch", "label": "Defect C: Seat Number vs Array Index Mismatch in Replay", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "HandHistory::replay() densely packed players into a Vec, violating the implicit engine-wide invariant that seat number == array index. Surfaced when a pkarena0-web session had a player leave between hands, leaving a gap seat \u2014 'Invalid action by Seat 8: Call 0'. Fix: build a sparse array of size max(max_seat, button_seat)+1 with default empty seats filling gaps."}, {"id": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_seat_number_equals_array_index", "label": "Invariant: Seat Number == Array Index", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SeatsNoCell is a plain Vec<SeatNoCell> and the entire engine (apply_action, next_to_act, get_seat_mut) assumes seats[i] is physical seat i. The invariant was load-bearing but implicit \u2014 not documented, not type-enforced, not tested with sparse inputs \u2014 so the first caller reconstructing the vec from serialized data (HandHistory::replay) violated it. Prevention: state engine-correctness invariants in an # Invariants doc comment and test with non-trivial (gap-seat) inputs."}, {"id": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026", "label": "RCA: Table Mechanic 2026", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026", "target": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_a_seat8_winner", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026", "target": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_b_orphaned_none_chips", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026", "target": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_c_seat_index_mismatch", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026", "target": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_seat_number_equals_array_index", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_a_seat8_winner", "target": "analysis_case_eval_caseeval", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": "src/analysis/case_eval.rs:231 winning_seats()", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_b_orphaned_none_chips", "target": "casino_table_no_cell_tablenocell", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": "showdown_multiway() Phase 2 loop", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_b_orphaned_none_chips", "target": "seats_table_equity_tableequity", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": "Seatbit::NONE dead-money entries", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_b_orphaned_none_chips", "target": "seats_seatbit_seatbit", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_b_orphaned_none_chips", "target": "table_showdown_showdown", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": "showdown.rs:273 same pre-fix pattern, flagged as live bug", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_c_seat_index_mismatch", "target": "src_hand_history_handhistory", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": "HandHistory::replay() src/hand_history.rs:385-405", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_c_seat_index_mismatch", "target": "casino_table_no_cell_tablenocell", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": "use_frozen path fix", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_seat_number_equals_array_index", "target": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026_defect_c_seat_index_mismatch", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026", "target": "pkdealer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": "Cross-Repo Impact", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_rca_table_mechanic_2026", "target": "pkarena0_web", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": "YAML session export was the direct trigger for Defect C", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "casino_table_no_cell_tablenocell", "target": "seats_table_equity_tableequity", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/RCA_Table_Mechanic_2026.md", "source_location": "showdown_multiway uses TableEquity equities()/winnings()", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}